  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10097\" class=\"elementor elementor-10097\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-fbe5651 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"99992\" data-id=\"fbe5651\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-0a02933 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-eae-slider=\"10540\" data-id=\"0a02933\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6956e80 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6956e80\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There&#8217;s something that happens when 16,000 people and over 5,500 dogs descend on one small Colorado town that no amount of preparation can fully capture — pure, unfiltered joy. That was Goldens in Golden 2026, held on Saturday, February 7th along Washington Avenue and Parfet Park in downtown Golden, and </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Drake Law Firm, PC</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> was proud to be right in the middle of it.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d6319f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3d6319f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"411\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Photo-Feb-07-2026-3-25-09-PM-768x411.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-10099\" alt=\"golden retrievers\" srcset=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Photo-Feb-07-2026-3-25-09-PM-768x411.jpg 768w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Photo-Feb-07-2026-3-25-09-PM-300x160.jpg 300w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Photo-Feb-07-2026-3-25-09-PM-1024x548.jpg 1024w, https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Photo-Feb-07-2026-3-25-09-PM.jpg 1290w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-c1b290b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"21191\" data-id=\"c1b290b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3873494 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3873494\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is \"Goldens in Golden?\"</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8af3d69 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8af3d69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you haven&#8217;t heard of it yet, Goldens in Golden is one of Colorado&#8217;s most beloved annual traditions — and it&#8217;s growing fast. Started in 2019, the event honors International Golden Retriever Day by turning </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/locations/golden/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">downtown Golden, Colorado</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> into what can only be described as the world&#8217;s largest, fluffiest block party. Washington Avenue closes to traffic, the iconic &#8220;Welcome to Golden&#8221; arch fills with wagging tails, and for a few hours, the whole town belongs to the dogs.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This year&#8217;s event was the biggest yet. Three official group photos were held under the arch, drawing crowds from across the country. There were vendor villages, dog-friendly shuttles, games, contests, and more smiles per square foot than you&#8217;ll find just about anywhere.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is, as organizers put it, arguably the happiest day of the year.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1c1c5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d1c1c5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Drake Law Firm, PC Was There — and We Came Ready</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-a7cb382 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"47349\" data-id=\"a7cb382\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-c2f0646 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-eae-slider=\"69189\" data-id=\"c2f0646\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8884b6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8884b6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For our team, Goldens in Golden wasn&#8217;t just a fun Saturday morning. It was an opportunity to show up for the community we serve every day. Golden is part of our home, and events like this are the heartbeat of what makes it such a special place to live and work.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our team was on the ground from 7:30 in the morning and didn&#8217;t stop moving until well after the official close. We set up our booth in the thick of the action and came stocked with goodies for both the four-legged and two-legged attendees:</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-912dc92 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"912dc92\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Photo-Feb-08-2026-8-37-41-PM-3-rp3ewyv2j57g6a507al0ta96oen3j26ne1yumy0nnc.jpg\" title=\"Photo Feb 08 2026, 8 37 41 PM (3)\" alt=\"The Drake Law Firm team\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de03a81 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"de03a81\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Photo-Feb-07-2026-4-36-10-PM-rp3ewyv2j57g6a507al0ta96oen3j26ne1yumy0nnc.jpg\" title=\"Screenshot\" alt=\"Screenshot\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd031c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bd031c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>300 tennis balls</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> — because no Golden can resist a good tennis ball</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>600 bags of dog treats</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> — fuel for all that tail-wagging</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>400 reflective collar tags</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> — a practical, safety-first gift for pups who love evening walks</span></li><li><b>75 tote bags</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> — for the humans carrying all the leashes, treats, and everything else</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-d47a413 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"84891\" data-id=\"d47a413\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85aa4b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"85aa4b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Everything was gone before we knew it. Our Plinko machine was a particular hit — at times it was six people deep waiting for a turn to play for prizes. Dogs nuzzled up for treats, kids grabbed tennis balls, and parents stopped to chat with our team. It was the kind of morning that reminds you why community matters.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And in a detail that genuinely surprised us: six different young people — pre-law undergrads and law students — stopped by to ask about internship opportunities. It was a reminder that showing up in your community has a way of opening doors you didn&#8217;t expect.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad94dfb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ad94dfb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A Day to Remember</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-46c058b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"67955\" data-id=\"46c058b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-ff5f021 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-eae-slider=\"98093\" data-id=\"ff5f021\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73e85db elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"73e85db\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By the time the morning wrapped up, our supplies were long gone and our team was buzzing. We&#8217;d met hundreds of Golden and Denver Metro area families, handed out enough treats to fuel a small army of retrievers, and had more than a few dogs try to follow us home.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goldens in Golden 2026 was a record-breaking success — and we&#8217;re already looking forward to next year.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you were there and stopped by our booth, thank you. If you missed us this time, keep an eye out — The Drake Law Firm, PC will be back.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9dc869d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9dc869d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Photo-Feb-07-2026-8-11-40-AM-scaled-rp3ewyv2j57g6a507al0ta96oen3j26ne1yumy0nnc.jpg\" title=\"Photo Feb 07 2026, 8 11 40 AM\" alt=\"Photo Feb 07 2026, 8 11 40 AM\" loading=\"lazy\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-bbb2952 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"64454\" data-id=\"bbb2952\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8aaeb3 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"f8aaeb3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-element elementor-element-2034020 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-eae-slider=\"18618\" data-id=\"2034020\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbee40a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cbee40a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Drake Law Firm, PC is a family law firm proudly serving Golden and </span></i><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/locations/lakewood/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lakewood, Colorado</span></i></a><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. We are committed to serving our clients and our community with integrity, care, and a whole lot of heart — Golden Retriever slobber optional.</span></i></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
